#!/data/data/com.termux/files/usr/bin/bash
ROOT="$(cd -- "$(dirname -- "$0")" && pwd)"
source "$ROOT/lib/colors.sh"
banner "TERMUX CYBER DOWNLOADER 2.0.1 HELP"
cat <<'HELP'
START
  DL                         Open the interactive main menu
  DL "https://..."           Open menu with a URL
  help                       Show this help page (after installing alias)

SHARE MENU
  Share a supported link from another Android app to Termux.
  Telegram t.me links are routed to the Telegram downloader.
  Supported file links are automatically downloaded to Documents or APKs.

VIDEO
  Choose a resolution: Best, 2160p, 1440p, 1080p, 720p, 480p, 360p.
  Turbo mode uses yt-dlp -N 8 where the source supports parallel fragments.
  Trim asks for start/end timestamps and the selected resolution.

VIDEO EXTRAS
  Download a video with English manual/automatic subtitles, or choose
  video-only mode with Best, 2160p, 1440p, 1080p, 720p, 480p, or 360p.

TELEGRAM
  Telegram downloads are saved in Movies/Telegram.
  Choose 1, 2, 4, or 8 transfer threads with the standard tdl package.
  The normal --continue option is used, but an interrupted file may restart.
  After a successful download, optionally create a 1080p, 720p, 480p,
  or 360p FFmpeg copy. The original file is never replaced.

QUEUE
  Queue items run sequentially. Failed or cancelled URLs remain in data/download_queue.txt.
  Edit the queue from the menu or with nano.

PLAYLISTS
  Before each playlist download, enter a folder name. The playlist is saved
  in Movies/<folder name>/ with numbered filenames. Reuse the same folder
  name when retrying an interrupted playlist download.

DOCUMENTS & FILES
  PDF, DOC/DOCX, XLS/XLSX, PPT/PPTX, ZIP/RAR/7z, EPUB, TXT, CSV, APK,
  and XAPK links are automatically routed to Documents or Documents/APKs.
  Downloads resume into the same URL-derived filename when the server
  supports HTTP range requests. Use menu option 12 to enter a file URL manually.

APK DOWNLOAD
  Direct APK URLs, APKPure, and F-Droid options are available.
  The old local APK scanner has been removed. Verify packages before installing.

NETWORK SHORTCUT
  Menu option 13 opens Android Radio Information.
  Choose LTE only for a 4G lock; restore Auto or LTE/WCDMA if calls or
  mobile service are affected. The general Android control panel is removed.

MOVIE / SERIES
  Search Google, JustWatch, or IMDb for legitimate sources.
  Paste a source URL only when downloading is permitted by that source.
  Choose a resolution and thread count before the yt-dlp download.

IMAGE & MEDIA TOOLS
  Download direct image URLs or social/gallery posts (gallery-dl required
  for supported gallery sites), save video thumbnails, and process local
  or downloaded images into crops, compressed formats, Expo assets, Web/PWA
  assets, or a PDF.

DEPENDENCIES
  pkg install git python ffmpeg termux-api nano curl tdl
  pip install -U yt-dlp
  Optional image tools: pip install -U gallery-dl pillow
  Install apkeep separately if you use APK source features.
HELP
